{"seq":2,"slug":"coroutines-and-tasks","title":"协程与任务调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/coroutines-and-tasks","wordCount":846,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"协程与任务调度\">协程与任务调度</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>协程（Coroutine）是 Python 异步编程的基本执行单元。通过 <code>async def</code> 定义、<code>await</code> 挂起，协程在事件循环中被包装为 Task 进行调度。理解协程的生命周期、Task 的创建与取消，是构建可靠异步系统的关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要理清异步模型，先区分三个层层递进的概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>协程（Coroutine）</strong>：用 <code>async def</code> 定义的可挂起函数，自身不会执行，必须被等待或包装。</li>\n<li><strong>Task</strong>：把协程交给事件循环调度的包装，是 <code>Future</code> 的子类，能被并行调度、取消与查询状态。</li>\n<li><strong>Future</strong>：一个&quot;结果的占位符&quot;，由外部（回调 API）或事件循环填充结果，本身不驱动协程。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>本质</th>\n<th>创建方式</th>\n<th>谁驱动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协程</td>\n<td>可挂起的执行体</td>\n<td>调用 <code>async def</code> 函数</td>\n<td>被 await 时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Task</td>\n<td>Future + 协程</td>\n<td><code>asyncio.create_task()</code></td>\n<td>事件循环自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Future</td>\n<td>异步结果占位符</td>\n<td><code>loop.create_future()</code></td>\n<td>外部 <code>set_result</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>协程的生命周期是状态机：创建 → 运行 → （遇 <code>await</code>）挂起 → 就绪后恢复 → 正常返回 / 取消 / 抛异常。取消采用协作方式——<code>cancel()</code> 只是请求，被取消方在下一个 <code>await</code> 点收到 <code>CancelledError</code>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"协程生命周期\">协程生命周期</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Created: async def 定义&#10;  Created --&gt; Running: await / ensure_future&#10;  Running --&gt; Suspended: 遇到 await&#10;  Suspended --&gt; Running: I/O 就绪&#10;  Running --&gt; Done: 正常返回&#10;  Running --&gt; Cancelled: cancel()&#10;  Running --&gt; Error: 抛出异常\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Created: async def 定义\n  Created --&gt; Running: await / ensure_future\n  Running --&gt; Suspended: 遇到 await\n  Suspended --&gt; Running: I/O 就绪\n  Running --&gt; Done: 正常返回\n  Running --&gt; Cancelled: cancel()\n  Running --&gt; Error: 抛出异常</pre><h3 id=\"协程-vs-生成器\">协程 vs 生成器</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>生成器（Generator）</th>\n<th>协程（Coroutine）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定义关键字</td>\n<td><code>def</code> + <code>yield</code></td>\n<td><code>async def</code> + <code>await</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>惰性序列生产</td>\n<td>异步 I/O 并发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度方式</td>\n<td>调用者手动 <code>next()</code></td>\n<td>事件循环自动调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回值</td>\n<td><code>yield</code> 产出值</td>\n<td><code>return</code> 或 <code>await</code> 结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"创建与运行-task\">创建与运行 Task</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import asyncio&#10;&#10;async def fetch_data(url: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    print(f&quot;Fetching {url}...&quot;)&#10;    await asyncio.sleep(1)&#10;    return f&quot;Data from {url}&quot;&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    task1 = asyncio.create_task(fetch_data(&quot;https://api.example.com/a&quot;))&#10;    task2 = asyncio.create_task(fetch_data(&quot;https://api.example.com/b&quot;))&#10;&#10;    result1 = await task1&#10;    result2 = await task2&#10;    print(result1, result2)&#10;&#10;asyncio.run(main())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Fetching </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">url</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Data from </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">url</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    task1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.create_task(fetch_data(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.example.com/a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    task2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.create_task(fetch_data(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.example.com/b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result1, result2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">asyncio.run(main())</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"task-的关键属性\">Task 的关键属性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性 / 方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>task.result()</code></td>\n<td>获取结果（任务完成后）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>task.exception()</code></td>\n<td>获取异常（任务失败后）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>task.cancel()</code></td>\n<td>请求取消任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>task.cancelled()</code></td>\n<td>是否已取消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>task.done()</code></td>\n<td>是否已完成（含取消和异常）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>task.get_name()</code></td>\n<td>获取任务名称</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"取消与超时\">取消与超时</h2><h3 id=\"任务取消\">任务取消</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def long_running():&#10;    try:&#10;        await asyncio.sleep(3600)&#10;    except asyncio.CancelledError:&#10;        print(&quot;Task was cancelled, cleaning up...&quot;)&#10;        raise&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    task = asyncio.create_task(long_running())&#10;    await asyncio.sleep(1)&#10;    task.cancel()&#10;    try:&#10;        await task&#10;    except asyncio.CancelledError:&#10;        print(&quot;Confirmed: task cancelled&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> long_running</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.CancelledError:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Task was cancelled, cleaning up...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.create_task(long_running())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    task.cancel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.CancelledError:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Confirmed: task cancelled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"超时控制\">超时控制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def main():&#10;    try:&#10;        async with asyncio.timeout(5):&#10;            result = await fetch_data(&quot;https://slow-api.com&quot;)&#10;    except TimeoutError:&#10;        print(&quot;Request timed out!&quot;)&#10;&#10;    result = await asyncio.wait_for(fetch_data(&quot;https://api.com&quot;), timeout=3.0)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.timeout(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fetch_data(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://slow-api.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TimeoutError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Request timed out!\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.wait_for(fetch_data(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>Python 版本</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>asyncio.timeout()</code></td>\n<td>上下文管理器</td>\n<td>3.11+</td>\n<td>推荐，结构化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>asyncio.wait_for()</code></td>\n<td>函数包装</td>\n<td>3.4+</td>\n<td>兼容旧版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"future-对象\">Future 对象</h2><p>Future 是 Task 的基类，表示一个尚未完成的异步操作结果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def main():&#10;    loop = asyncio.get_running_loop()&#10;    future = loop.create_future()&#10;&#10;    async def set_result():&#10;        await asyncio.sleep(1)&#10;        future.set_result(&quot;Done!&quot;)&#10;&#10;    asyncio.create_task(set_result())&#10;    result = await future&#10;    print(result)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loop </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.get_running_loop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    future </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loop.create_future()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> set_result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        future.set_result(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Done!\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    asyncio.create_task(set_result())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> future</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"task-vs-future\">Task vs Future</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Future</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本质</td>\n<td>异步结果的占位符</td>\n<td>Future + 协程的封装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创建方式</td>\n<td><code>loop.create_future()</code></td>\n<td><code>asyncio.create_task()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驱动方式</td>\n<td>外部调用 <code>set_result</code></td>\n<td>事件循环自动驱动协程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用频率</td>\n<td>低（桥接回调API）</td>\n<td>高（日常开发）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"异步生成器\">异步生成器</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def countdown(n: int):&#10;    while n &gt; 0:&#10;        yield n&#10;        await asyncio.sleep(0.5)&#10;        n -= 1&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    async for num in countdown(5):&#10;        print(num)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> countdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        yield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> countdown(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>异步生成器结合了生成器的惰性产出和协程的异步等待，适用于分页查询、流式数据等场景。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"任务命名与内省\">任务命名与内省</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def worker(task_id: int):&#10;    await asyncio.sleep(1)&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    tasks = [&#10;        asyncio.create_task(worker(i), name=f&quot;worker-{i}&quot;)&#10;        for i in range(5)&#10;    ]&#10;    for task in asyncio.all_tasks():&#10;        print(task.get_name())&#10;    await asyncio.gather(*tasks)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> worker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.sleep(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tasks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        asyncio.create_task(worker(i), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"worker-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.all_tasks():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task.get_name())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.gather(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tasks)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>总是 await 或 gather 创建的 Task，避免&quot;发射并忘记&quot;导致异常被静默吞掉</li>\n<li>在 <code>CancelledError</code> 处理中执行清理逻辑后重新 <code>raise</code>，保持取消传播</li>\n<li>为 Task 设置有意义的名称，便于调试和日志追踪</li>\n<li>使用 <code>asyncio.timeout()</code> 替代 <code>wait_for</code> 获得更清晰的超时语义</li>\n<li>避免创建大量无限制的并发 Task，使用信号量或 TaskGroup 控制并发度</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>协程是可挂起的执行体，Task 是其调度包装，Future 是异步结果的占位符——三者层层递进。</li>\n<li>协程生命周期为状态机：创建 → 运行 → 挂起 → 恢复 → 返回/取消/异常。</li>\n<li><code>asyncio.create_task()</code> 让协程并行调度；Task 通过 <code>result()</code>、<code>exception()</code>、<code>cancel()</code> 等管理结果与状态。</li>\n<li>取消是协作式的：<code>CancelledError</code> 处理中应清理资源后重新 <code>raise</code>。</li>\n<li>超时优先用 3.11+ 的 <code>asyncio.timeout()</code> 上下文管理器，旧版本用 <code>wait_for()</code>。</li>\n<li>异步生成器结合惰性产出与异步等待，适合分页查询与流式数据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协程与任务调度","id":"协程与任务调度"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"协程生命周期","id":"协程生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"协程 vs 生成器","id":"协程-vs-生成器"},{"level":2,"text":"创建与运行 Task","id":"创建与运行-task"},{"level":3,"text":"Task 的关键属性","id":"task-的关键属性"},{"level":2,"text":"取消与超时","id":"取消与超时"},{"level":3,"text":"任务取消","id":"任务取消"},{"level":3,"text":"超时控制","id":"超时控制"},{"level":2,"text":"Future 对象","id":"future-对象"},{"level":3,"text":"Task vs Future","id":"task-vs-future"},{"level":2,"text":"异步生成器","id":"异步生成器"},{"level":2,"text":"任务命名与内省","id":"任务命名与内省"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"asyncio 事件循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/asyncio-event-loop"},"next":{"title":"异步 IO 与网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/async-io"}}